 "title": "Core principles of building a personal brand",
 "topic": "business ideas",
 "summary": "Personal branding is about proving your value through work rather than just gaining online followers. You build your brand offline, then establish it online.",
 "key_points": [
  "Personal branding consists of 90% personal work and 10% branding.",
  "A brand is built offline when nobody is watching; it is only established online.",
  "Having a large follower count does not equal having a personal brand.",
  "Proof of work is the essential element that builds a personal brand.",
  "Focus on being good at what you do and having tangible results to show for it."
 ],
 "content": "Personal branding is 90% personal and 10% branding. If you think a personal brand is built online, you are wrong. The truth is, a personal brand is built offline when nobody is watching. It is only established online. A lot of followers does not make you a personal brand. A lot of work and proof of work makes you one. It is only because of Sudharsanan. I want to give the credit to Sudharsanan Ganapathy, my friend. He is not just as a personal branding coach, he is more of a life coach. If you are someone who shares the same philosophy as me and you have been wanting to establish a personal brand online, I think I can help you. My name is Sudharsanan Ganapathy, I have trained thousands of business owners in building a solid personal brand and help them grow in their businesses. If you have a lot of work to show for and if you're very good at what you do, I think you should be in my workshop. In my 4hr personal branding mastery workshop, I teach exactly how to build a personal brand. Register for my workshop right away and I'll see you inside. Text shown on screen: Personal branding is 90% PERSONAL and 10% BRANDING. PERSONAL BRAND IS BUILT OFFLINE WHEN NOBODY IS WATCHING. A LOT OF WORK AND PROOF OF WORK MAKES YOU ONE. SUDHARSANAN GANAPATHY PERSONAL BRANDING EXPERT. IN MY 4HR PERSONAL BRANDING MASTERY WORKSHOP. REGISTER NOW.",
